  * 
  *                 SPLIT THE HYPERBOLIC COMPONENTS IN 2
  * 
  * ----------------------------------------------------------------------
  * 
  * 
  * 
  * 
  * 
  * 
  * 
  * 
  * 
  reparameterize
  transform which mapping?
  rotHull
  set corners
  0.5 1 0. 1. 0. 1.
  share
  9 6 0 0 7 0 
  boundary conditions
  5 1 0 0 3 0
  mappingName
  hlfHull
  exit
  * 
  reparameterize
  transform which mapping?
  rotBow
  set corners
  0. 1. 0. 0.5 0. 1.
  share
  0 6 0 9 7 0
  boundary conditions
  0 1 0 5 3 0
  mappingName
  hlfBow
  exit
  * 
  * 
  reparameterize
  transform which mapping?
  rotStern
  set corners
  0 1 0 0.5 0 1
  share
  6 0 0 9 7 0 
  boundary conditions
  1 0 0 5 3 0
  mappingName
  hlfStern
  exit
