  stretch coordinates
  transform which mapping?
  core
  stretch
  specify stretching along axis=1
  layers
  1
  6 8 1
  exit
  exit
  mappingName
  strCore
  exit
  * 
  stretch coordinates
  transform which mapping?
  cylinder
  stretch
  specify stretching along axis=2
  layers
  1
  11 21 0
  exit
  specify stretching along axis=1
  layers
  1
  6 8 1
  exit 
  exit
  mappingName
  strCylinder
  exit
  * 
  stretch coordinates
  transform which mapping?
  hlfHull
  stretch
  specify stretching along axis=1
  layers
  2
  4 3 0
  4 3 1
  exit
  specify stretching along axis=0
  layers
  3
  3 12 1
  3 3  0 
  3 5 0.5
  exit
  *specify stretching along axis=2
  *layers
  *1
  *1 2 0
  *exit
  exit
  mappingName
  strHull
  exit
  * 
  stretch coordinates
  transform which mapping?
  hlfStern
  stretch
  specify stretching along axis=0
  layers
  3
  4 7 0
  5 6 .8
  5 6 1
  exit
  *specify stretching along axis=2
  *layers
  *1
  *1 5 0
  *exit
  specify stretching along axis=1
  layers
  2
  2 3 1
  2 3 0
